<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>VednamKrishna | Your Shop, Your Choice</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
<body>
<img src="file_00000000496482088519026bbf8542a3.png"
     alt="VednamKrishna Logo"
     width="150">
{margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#fffaf1;color:#17233b}
header{background:#082747;color:white;text-align:center;padding:24px 12px}
header h1{margin:0;color:#ffcf55;font-size:clamp(27px,7vw,42px)}
header p{margin:8px 0 0}
main{max-width:900px;margin:auto;padding:16px}
.hero{background:#f2e4ce;border-radius:16px;padding:22px;text-align:center}
.hero h2{margin-top:0}
.shop-photo{display:block;width:100%;max-height:440px;object-fit:contain;background:#eee;border-radius:12px;margin-top:14px}
.categories{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px;margin:18px 0}
.category{background:white;border:1px solid #ead7b7;border-radius:12px;padding:18px 8px;text-align:center;font-weight:bold}
h2{color:#082747}
.products{border:1px dashed #c9b58f;border-radius:14px;padding:18px;background:white}
form{display:grid;gap:12px}
input,textarea,button{font:inherit;padding:12px;border-radius:9px}
input,textarea{border:1px solid #c9c9c9;width:100%}
button{border:0;background:#082747;color:white;font-weight:bold}
.note{font-size:13px;color:#5e6470}
footer{text-align:center;background:#082747;color:white;padding:20px;margin-top:25px}
</style>
</head>
</body>
<header>
<h1>VednamKrishna</h1>
<p>Your Shop, Your Choice.</p>
</header>
<main>
<section class="hero">
<h2>Har Roz Kuch Naya ✨</h2>
<p>Apni pasand ka samaan dekhein aur shop se pickup karein.</p>
<img class="shop-photo" src="shop.jpg" alt="VednamKrishna shop" onerror="this.style.display='none'">
<p class="note">Shop photo yahan shop.jpg file upload karne ke baad dikhegi.</p>
</section>
<div class="categories">
<div class="category">💄 Cosmetics & Makeup</div>
<div class="category">💍 Bangles & Jewellery</div>
<div class="category">🧸 Toys & Gifts</div>
<div class="category">👟 Footwear</div>
<div class="category">🛍️ Daily-use Items</div>
<div class="category">✨ Special Requests</div>
</div>
<section class="products">
<h2>Products & Prices</h2>
<p>Products ki photos aur confirmed prices jald yahan add honge.</p>
<p class="note">Abhi live product catalogue aur order submission connect nahi hua hai.</p>
</section>
<section>
<h2>Request a Product</h2>
<p>Jo samaan chahiye, uska naam aur details likhein.</p>
<form onsubmit="event.preventDefault();alert('Ye demo form hai. Aapki request abhi send ya save nahi hui.');">
<input name="customer" placeholder="Aapka naam" required>
<input name="phone" type="tel" placeholder="Mobile number" required>
<textarea name="product" placeholder="Product ka naam, colour, size ya quantity" rows="3" required></textarea>
<button type="submit">Request Preview</button>
</form>
<p class="note">Filhaal ye preview hai. Customer ki request receive karne ke liye backend connect karna hoga.</p>
</section>
</main>
<footer>VednamKrishna · Your Shop, Your Choice.<br>Shop pickup available</footer>
</body>
</html>
